.TH FSVR 1 "2026-10-20" "de-xr" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fsvr \- explore files in a Qt6 and Vulkan spatial view
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
fsvr [OPTIONS] [LOCATIONS...]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Explore directories as spatial objects, with tabs, previews, bookmarks, Trash and file operations. Locations may be local paths, file: URLs or trash:/. Additional locations open additional tabs.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B "\-\-desktop"
Force desktop presentation.
.TP
.B "\-\-domed"
Use the DomeD bridge while preserving the launching desktop or XR realm.
.TP
.B "\-\-xr"
Start a standalone OpenXR session outside DomeD; requires an XR\-enabled build and active runtime. Inside DomeD, launch without this option for mouse and keyboard input.
.TP
.B "\-\-select"
Reveal supplied files in their parent locations.
.TP
.B "\-\-properties"
Reveal supplied files and display their properties.
.TP
.B "\-\-smoke\-test"
Render for approximately three seconds and exit for diagnostics.
.TP
.B "\-\-help, \-\-help\-all"
Show command\-line help.
.TP
.B "\-\-version"
Show version.
.SH KEYS
Ctrl+T opens a tab, Ctrl+W closes a tab, Ctrl+Tab and Ctrl+Shift+Tab switch tabs. F5 refreshes the current filesystem snapshot.
Inside DomeD, Super+F10 opens the universal menu strip. Arrow keys navigate,
Enter activates, and Escape dismisses. Ctrl+L selects the location field.
Native File, Edit, View, Go, Window and Help menus follow the current selection
and layout. Clipboard commands operate on focused text while editing.
.SH FILES
$XDG_DATA_HOME/user\-places.xbel supplies local Places bookmarks. $XDG_CACHE_HOME/fsvr/index\-v1 holds a bounded, revalidated preview index.
.SH SEE ALSO
dome\-compositor(1), qimgvr(1)
